-- ACNV2_ONLY C_ONLY NO_AUTOMATIC_TEST_CASES
-- A determinant of the SEQUENCE sizes both a direct child and, through an
-- ACN parameter, a field of a reference child. It is deferred; the decoder
-- of the direct child must still find its value, and the encoder must patch
-- it from the direct child too, or reject a size that disagrees. Values
-- whose sizes differ cannot be encoded, so the automatic test cases are not
-- run; scripts/runWireTests.sh checks the encoding (017_wire_test.c).
TEST-CASE DEFINITIONS AUTOMATIC TAGS ::= BEGIN

Item ::= SEQUENCE {
    data OCTET STRING (SIZE (1..4))
}

Msg ::= SEQUENCE {
    head OCTET STRING (SIZE (1..4)),
    payload Item
}

END

--TCFS   017.acn
